=== strip default whitespace
strings.Trim(s, " \t\n\r\v\f")

=== strip custom chars
strings.Trim(s, "xy")

=== lstrip default whitespace
strings.TrimLeft(s, " \t\n\r\v\f")

=== rstrip default whitespace
strings.TrimRight(s, " \t\n\r\v\f")

=== fstring repr conversion
ToRepr(x)

=== fstring str conversion
strconv.Itoa(x)
